  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **`TessageDispatchingFailedException`'s message says \"Remote exception:\" before the remote handler's exception,** where it said \"Remote exception tessage:\".\n- **A tevent runs its handlers in the order they were registered, whatever types they subscribe to, and that order is now a guarantee:** a handler may depend on what the handlers registered before it did. The engine grouped the handlers by the type they subscribe to, so registering a handler for `IUserTevent`, then one for `IUserRegistered`, then another for `IUserTevent`, ran the third before the second, where Compze.Teventive's introduction promised the order of registration.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.10.0-internal (was 0.9.0-internal), Compze.Threading 0.13.0-alpha (was 0.12.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
